DESCRIPTION <b>mag2ora</b>  is an Earthworm module that reads magnitude
messages(TYPE_MAGNITUDE) from an EW ring, and creates magnitudes in 
an EWDB and associates the Magnitudes with Events.

Initial version  2001/06/21  lucky
